            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "- **Protons** (positive charge) — these decide what element the atom is.",
            "start": 100,
            "end": 172
          },
          {
            "id": "p4",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "- **Neutrons** (no charge) — these add weight but don’t change the element.",
            "start": 173,
            "end": 248
          },
          {
            "id": "p5",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "- **Electrons** (negative charge) — these orbit around the nucleus.",
            "start": 249,
            "end": 316
          },
